nistration Delivers 15 Straight Months of Zero ...","url":"https://www.dhs.gov/news/2026/08/13/trump-administration-delivers-15-straight-months-zero-releases-border"},{"date":"Oct 16, 2026","position":5,"site_name":"www.dhs.gov","snippet":"A Safer Border President Trump’s policies are also saving lives by reducing unlawful crossings, leading to a dramatic decline in border-related deaths. Fewer unlawful crossings have contributed to a significant decline in border-related deaths.","title":"Under President Trump and Secretary Mullin, DHS Announces ...","url":"https://www.dhs.gov/news/2026/10/16/under-president-trump-and-secretary-mullin-dhs-announces-lowest-fiscal-year-border"},{"date":"Apr 18, 2025","position":6,"site_name":"mexiconewsdaily.com","snippet":"Both the number of migrants detected by United States authorities after illegally crossing the Mexico-U.S. border and the quantity of fentanyl seized at the border have significantly decreased ...","title":"Fact check: Border crossings and drug seizures plummet, but ...","url":"https://mexiconewsdaily.com/news/fact-check-border-crossings-and-drug-seizures-plummet-statistics-dont-align/"},{"date":"Sep 16, 2026","position":7,"site_name":"www.cbp.gov","snippet":"U.S. Customs and Border Protection provides information on border security, trade, travel, customs regulations, trusted traveler programs and enforcement news to the public.","title":"Drug Seizure Statistics - U.S. Customs and Border Protection","url":"https://www.cbp.gov/newsroom/stats/drug-seizure-statistics"}],"total_results":7,"page":0}